&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Engineering, Applied AI, and Partnerships to design tailored solutions and support complex deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build co-sell motions with hyperscaler and system integrator partners, including joint customer engagements and marketplace procurement, to extend reach across the territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify new use cases and feed customer and market insights back into the product roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Anthropic with customers, partners, and industry stakeholders in Taiwan, including conversations about the safe and responsible use of AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
